  message: "Investigation + partial fix (audit 2026-04-26). Cohort cohort-001/iter-001 (deep-20260425-210357) surfaced 4 distinct producer leaks into the language slot of synthesized boundary nodes — same INV-nodij invariant the toml_config fix (PR #3362) addressed for one producer, but multiple others were untouched. (1) Vue analyzer's imports_component edge emitter — 871 leaks on chatwoot. **FIXED in PR #3385 (commit 8e7960a35)**: dst now constructs a properly-formed 5-part id (vue:{path}:0-0:{name}:component); raw import_path preserved on edge.meta for the linker's path-resolution. (2) airflow .rst leaks — 3,079. **Not yet fixed** — filed as separate work item. (3) alertmanager/prometheus jsonnet leaks — 50/63. **Not yet fixed** — filed as separate work item. (4) kafka properties/manifest extractor leaks — 56. **Not yet fixed** — filed as separate work item. Plus 'unresolved' sentinel-vs-leak question (alertmanager 39 nodes) filed as a fourth item. Per the scope-expansion protocol, this umbrella WI-vobiv stays open until all 4 sub-producer leaks are addressed AND a future cohort confirms cohort-wide MOVED on INV-nodij. The Vue fix is structurally validated by a property test (TestImportsComponentDstIdShape) so it should automatically MOVE on the next cohort."  # 9fcf
